# Web derivatives produced by `npm run media` are small and deployed with the
# site, so they live in regular git — NOT Git LFS. This keeps Vercel builds
# working without LFS enabled (no LFS bandwidth spent per deploy).
# Full-resolution originals under media/ stay on the repo-wide LFS rules.
public/media/** !filter !diff !merge binary
public/brand/** !filter !diff !merge binary
app/*.png !filter !diff !merge binary
app/*.jpg !filter !diff !merge binary
